      "stemBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "text": "What is the output of \"pin1\" if \"pin2\" is sent \"1011\" where 1 is 5V and 0 is 0V?\n\n```cpp\nint pin1 = 12;\nint pin2 = 11;\n\nvoid setup() {\n  pinMode(pin1, OUTPUT);\n  pinMode(pin2, INPUT);\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n}\n\nvoid loop() {\n  if (digitalRead(pin2) == 1) {\n    digitalWrite(pin1, LOW);\n  }\n  else if (digitalRead(pin2) == 0) {\n    digitalWrite(pin1, HIGH);\n  }\n}\n```"
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "sourceLabel": "A",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "markdown",
              "text": "1110"
            }
